(text "MS1 = MS2 = VDD (3.3 V): 1/16 step, 3200 pulses/rev. No MCU pins needed.\nSPRD jumper open: factory StealthChop mode. Current set with each onboard potentiometer." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a3d6c681-a27c-531d-bcb8-719c5759713c"))
(text "M2: 1.0 A/phase, 4.1 ohm, 8.5 mH; coil pairs 1-4 and 3-6 (user-confirmed).\nM3: 0.84 A/phase, 6.0 ohm, 8.8 mH; 20T / 2 mm pulley -> 40 mm/rev -> 80 pulses/mm.\nBoth motors: 1.8 deg. Adjust current separately; respect peak/RMS conventions.\nA3/A4 mount at J105/J106 via JP4 headers; JP1 power/motor cables stay directly on each module." (at 20.32 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ebb17bb-12b4-5575-b4aa-95314e64f0b9"))
